section(data-color="white" id="faq").faq.colorSection
  .faq__wrapper
    .faq__header._anim-items._anim-no-hide
      h6.subtitle.faq__subtitle FAQ
      h2.h2.faq__title Frequently asked questions

    .faq__list._anim-items._anim-no-hide
      .faq__item
        button.faq__question
          span What types of projects do you work on?
          svg.faq__icon(width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
            path(d="M12 5v14M5 12h14")
        .faq__answer
          p We specialize in complex AI products, Agentic AI systems, and full-cycle software development — from MVP to production SaaS. Our sweet spot is Hospitality, Procurement & Supply Chain, FinTech, EdTech, and enterprise automation. If it involves AI and real engineering challenges, we're in.

      .faq__item
        button.faq__question
          span How long does a typical project take?
          svg.faq__icon(width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
            path(d="M12 5v14M5 12h14")
        .faq__answer
          p It depends on scope. A focused PoC or MVP can be ready in 2–6 weeks. Larger products with full design, backend, and AI pipelines typically take 3–6 months. We always start with a clear scope and timeline before writing any code.

      .faq__item
        button.faq__question
          span Do you work with startups or enterprises?
          svg.faq__icon(width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
            path(d="M12 5v14M5 12h14")
        .faq__answer
          p Both. We've co-created 30+ projects — from pre-seed startups building their first product to established US companies modernizing legacy systems with AI. What matters to us is the challenge and the people behind it, not the stage.

      .faq__item
        button.faq__question
          span What's your pricing model?
          svg.faq__icon(width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
            path(d="M12 5v14M5 12h14")
        .faq__answer
          p We work on a fixed-scope or monthly retainer basis — depending on the project. No hourly billing, no surprises. We estimate honestly and communicate proactively. Every engagement starts with a free discovery call.

      .faq__item
        button.faq__question
          span Can you work as a fractional CTO or technical partner?
          svg.faq__icon(width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round")
            path(d="M12 5v14M5 12h14")
        .faq__answer
          p Absolutely. Several of our clients rely on us as their long-term technical leadership. We handle architecture, hiring guidance, tech strategy, and hands-on development — like an in-house team, but without the overhead.

